    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108765" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομείγνυμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mix in, add by mixing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζύμωμά τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					74d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				71b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑπομεμιγμένον τῆς
			λύπης</span> the <i>admixture,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				47a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. and
			metaph., <i>come near secretly,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τῇ Χερσονήσῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.102
				</span></i>
			.</div>
